1
00:00:48,930 --> 00:00:53,010
[The Old Story of Yu Hong]

2
00:00:53,390 --> 00:00:55,950
[Episode 22]

3
00:00:57,380 --> 00:00:58,750
Sorry, I'm late.

4
00:00:58,750 --> 00:00:59,280
Ms. Chen.

5
00:00:59,780 --> 00:01:00,970
This must be the bride.

6
00:01:00,970 --> 00:01:01,920
Gorgeous.

7
00:01:01,920 --> 00:01:03,850
Aren't you going to
introduce us, Liu Yang?

8
00:01:03,850 --> 00:01:05,450
Here, take the red envelope.

9
00:01:05,900 --> 00:01:06,680
That's one thick envelope.

10
00:01:06,680 --> 00:01:07,620
It's thicker than the Xinhua Dictionary.

11
00:01:07,620 --> 00:01:08,500
How much is in here?

12
00:01:08,500 --> 00:01:09,039
How much is in here?

13
00:01:09,039 --> 00:01:09,950
Ms. Chen sure is generous.

14
00:01:09,950 --> 00:01:10,500
Take it.

15
00:01:12,180 --> 00:01:13,340
Don't go yet, bride.

16
00:01:13,370 --> 00:01:13,890
Come on.

17
00:01:13,920 --> 00:01:15,920
Today I want to toast the two of them.

18
00:01:16,210 --> 00:01:18,190
The first glass is to fate.

19
00:01:18,260 --> 00:01:19,260
It's not easy for two people

20
00:01:19,260 --> 00:01:21,550
to go from meeting to staying together.

21
00:01:21,650 --> 00:01:23,620
May their future days

22
00:01:23,650 --> 00:01:25,200
be just like this wine,

23
00:01:25,330 --> 00:01:26,670
getting better with time.

24
00:01:26,670 --> 00:01:27,020
Yes.

25
00:01:27,039 --> 00:01:27,710
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

26
00:01:27,710 --> 00:01:28,020
Come on.

27
00:01:28,020 --> 00:01:29,080
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

28
00:01:30,760 --> 00:01:31,510
I'll pour another.

29
00:01:31,510 --> 00:01:32,509
With the second glass,

30
00:01:32,509 --> 00:01:33,340
I wish them

31
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:35,940
a lifetime together,
growing old side by side,

32
00:01:36,009 --> 00:01:36,930
never leaving each other.

33
00:01:36,930 --> 00:01:37,590
-Good!
-Good!

34
00:01:37,590 --> 00:01:38,479
Never leaving each other.

35
00:01:38,479 --> 00:01:39,310
Never leaving each other.

36
00:01:39,310 --> 00:01:39,880
Good.

37
00:01:41,700 --> 00:01:42,509
The third glass.

38
00:01:42,509 --> 00:01:42,930
Here.

39
00:01:43,090 --> 00:01:43,680
With the third glass,

40
00:01:43,680 --> 00:01:45,500
I want to thank everyone
on behalf of Liu Yang.

41
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:46,789
Thank you, family and friends,

42
00:01:46,789 --> 00:01:48,400
for coming to support Liu Yang today.

43
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:50,030
Thank you all.

44
00:01:50,150 --> 00:01:51,000
Come on.

45
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:53,509
Let's all wish this newlywed couple

46
00:01:53,509 --> 00:01:56,430
prosperous days and fragrant wine,

47
00:01:56,430 --> 00:01:59,979
a love that outshines the Songhua River!

48
00:01:59,979 --> 00:02:01,180
-Thank you all.
-Cheers!

49
00:02:01,180 --> 00:02:02,340
Thank you.

50
00:02:03,060 --> 00:02:04,500
Thank you.

51
00:02:04,500 --> 00:02:05,310
Cheers!

52
00:02:05,310 --> 00:02:05,900
Cheers!

53
00:02:07,180 --> 00:02:07,900
Happy day. Here.

54
00:02:07,900 --> 00:02:08,229
Okay.

55
00:02:08,740 --> 00:02:09,340
Liu Yang.

56
00:02:09,410 --> 00:02:10,259
Well,

57
00:02:10,289 --> 00:02:11,750
introduce me to everyone.

58
00:02:22,340 --> 00:02:29,130
[Happiness]

59
00:02:43,410 --> 00:02:45,630
It's our wedding. What's wrong?

60
00:02:48,410 --> 00:02:50,030
I'm not feeling well.

61
00:02:50,240 --> 00:02:51,440
I'm going home first.

62
00:02:55,810 --> 00:02:56,180
Juan.

63
00:02:57,840 --> 00:02:58,520
This is...

64
00:02:58,920 --> 00:02:59,210
This is...

65
00:02:59,210 --> 00:03:00,060
Chen Hong.

66
00:03:00,460 --> 00:03:01,560
Real sister?

67
00:03:29,650 --> 00:03:30,650
Juan, don't drink too much.

68
00:03:30,650 --> 00:03:32,079
I have to work tomorrow.

69
00:03:34,840 --> 00:03:35,710
What are you two doing

70
00:03:35,710 --> 00:03:36,590
standing here?

71
00:03:36,590 --> 00:03:37,760
Aren't you cold?

72
00:03:40,630 --> 00:03:41,430
What's wrong?

73
00:03:42,250 --> 00:03:43,550
I'm not feeling well.

74
00:03:43,620 --> 00:03:44,820
I'm going home first.

75
00:03:44,970 --> 00:03:45,520
Okay.

76
00:03:46,090 --> 00:03:47,150
I'll take you back.

77
00:03:47,750 --> 00:03:48,820
Here, take this.

78
00:03:49,970 --> 00:03:51,370
Don't give it to Liu Yang.

79
00:03:51,430 --> 00:03:52,560
As you two are building a life together,

80
00:03:52,560 --> 00:03:54,120
you'll need money for lots of things.

81
00:03:54,120 --> 00:03:55,180
You keep the money.

82
00:03:56,190 --> 00:03:58,190
If I've done anything wrong before,

83
00:03:58,280 --> 00:04:00,280
or haven't been thoughtful enough,

84
00:04:01,690 --> 00:04:02,620
forgive me.

85
00:04:03,410 --> 00:04:05,030
From now on, we're family.

86
00:04:06,250 --> 00:04:07,900
If you need anything, just tell me.

87
00:04:07,900 --> 00:04:08,960
Don't be so polite.

88
00:04:08,970 --> 00:04:10,560
If your mom needs care

89
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,710
or anything,

90
00:04:12,090 --> 00:04:12,970
just tell me.

91
00:04:13,900 --> 00:04:14,700
We're family.

92
00:04:19,740 --> 00:04:21,329
Alright, don't stay here anymore.

93
00:04:21,329 --> 00:04:23,070
There's no one
from our family left inside.

94
00:04:23,070 --> 00:04:25,200
Hurry and go entertain the guests. Go.

95
00:04:25,660 --> 00:04:27,160
I've got this. I'll take Jie home.

96
00:04:27,160 --> 00:04:27,810
Go ahead.

97
00:04:28,360 --> 00:04:30,690
Come on, get in the car.
It's too cold here.

98
00:04:35,240 --> 00:04:36,680
Go now. Stop standing here.

99
00:04:36,680 --> 00:04:37,620
Keep an eye on her.

100
00:04:37,620 --> 00:04:38,270
Alright, alright.

101
00:04:38,270 --> 00:04:40,000
Go quickly. Don't catch a cold.

102
00:04:40,180 --> 00:04:41,180
Let's go, driver.

103
00:05:24,600 --> 00:05:25,950
Are you crazy?

104
00:05:40,540 --> 00:05:41,810
Stop pretending.

105
00:05:44,370 --> 00:05:45,180
The money for the wedding

106
00:05:45,180 --> 00:05:46,270
all came from me.

107
00:05:53,370 --> 00:05:55,450
I'm getting married today.

108
00:06:03,040 --> 00:06:04,620
Who hasn't been married?

109
00:06:06,180 --> 00:06:07,040
Let me tell you.

110
00:06:08,420 --> 00:06:09,930
No matter who you marry,

111
00:06:10,810 --> 00:06:11,940
it all ends the same.

112
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,520
I've endured it for half my life.

113
00:06:16,270 --> 00:06:18,130
I don't want to endure it anymore.

114
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:27,870
You're sick.

115
00:06:28,870 --> 00:06:30,270
I'm not sick.

116
00:06:32,890 --> 00:06:34,270
I just have bad luck.

117
00:06:36,330 --> 00:06:37,510
That sickly woman

118
00:06:38,540 --> 00:06:40,120
only has half a life left.

119
00:06:42,010 --> 00:06:43,870
And you still rushed to marry her.

120
00:06:45,600 --> 00:06:47,400
That hooker from the hair salon—

121
00:06:48,390 --> 00:06:49,250
so dirty,

122
00:06:51,250 --> 00:06:53,180
but her husband spoils her rotten.

123
00:06:56,310 --> 00:06:58,370
I'm the only one who doesn't get that.

124
00:07:09,300 --> 00:07:10,960
What exactly is wrong with me?

125
00:07:54,240 --> 00:07:59,060
[Bridegroom]

126
00:09:50,780 --> 00:09:59,180
[Yuhong Stadium]

127
00:10:22,860 --> 00:10:27,510
[Yuhong Stadium]

128
00:10:42,960 --> 00:10:43,770
Who is it?

129
00:10:57,580 --> 00:10:58,320
Come in.

130
00:11:01,130 --> 00:11:02,530
My husband is on the road.

131
00:11:03,040 --> 00:11:04,840
He'll be back tomorrow morning.

132
00:11:05,340 --> 00:11:07,000
You have to leave before five.

133
00:11:20,630 --> 00:11:22,090
I just came to wash my hair.

134
00:11:46,630 --> 00:11:47,560
First time, huh?

135
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:54,870
You can come by anytime.

136
00:11:56,620 --> 00:11:58,220
I'll give you a good massage.

137
00:12:04,930 --> 00:12:06,420
Your muscles are so tight.

138
00:12:07,500 --> 00:12:09,160
Drink less next time you come.

139
00:12:10,110 --> 00:12:12,000
T-This little bit of alcohol is nothing.

140
00:12:12,000 --> 00:12:13,010
Doesn't affect me at all.

141
00:12:13,010 --> 00:12:14,670
I'm really strong, actually.

142
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:25,090
The one getting married today—

143
00:12:25,670 --> 00:12:27,400
that's Juan's brother, right?

144
00:12:28,770 --> 00:12:29,390
Yes.

145
00:12:31,150 --> 00:12:32,810
That's my buddy and my sister.

146
00:12:33,500 --> 00:12:34,960
Did you cry at the wedding?

147
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,220
No.

148
00:12:37,460 --> 00:12:38,340
Why would I cry?

149
00:12:40,670 --> 00:12:42,720
My sister was the prettiest in her class.

150
00:12:42,720 --> 00:12:43,650
She's gorgeous.

151
00:12:44,670 --> 00:12:46,270
You're pretty handsome too.

152
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:49,940
Really?

153
00:12:53,320 --> 00:12:54,550
You're so kind.

154
00:12:56,630 --> 00:12:57,670
Me, kind?

155
00:13:00,240 --> 00:13:01,770
Some people call me slutty,

156
00:13:01,790 --> 00:13:02,940
saying I'm hot.

157
00:13:05,220 --> 00:13:06,360
But calling me kind,

158
00:13:07,080 --> 00:13:08,280
you're the first one.

159
00:13:10,890 --> 00:13:12,720
Is it bad to call someone kind?

160
00:13:13,370 --> 00:13:14,010
You...

161
00:13:14,010 --> 00:13:15,170
Y-You're pretty.

162
00:13:16,010 --> 00:13:17,810
You're prettier than my sister.

163
00:13:19,840 --> 00:13:20,890
I heard you sister

164
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:22,500
isn't doing well.

165
00:13:23,630 --> 00:13:24,480
How is she now?

166
00:13:32,340 --> 00:13:35,440
[Blood Testing Room]

167
00:13:51,620 --> 00:13:53,950
[Tiedong District People's Hospital
Outpatient HLA Typing Room]

168
00:13:53,980 --> 00:13:57,010
[The accuracy of genotyping
is around 99.0%]

169
00:13:58,000 --> 00:13:59,700
Actually, as long as I agree,

170
00:14:01,980 --> 00:14:03,870
the doctors can
do the surgery for my sister.

171
00:14:03,750 --> 00:14:04,730
[Tiedong District People's Hospital
Outpatient HLA Typing Room]

172
00:14:04,750 --> 00:14:05,920
[The accuracy of genotyping
is around 99.0%]

173
00:14:07,600 --> 00:14:08,820
My mom and sister

174
00:14:09,620 --> 00:14:11,150
didn't see my test results.

175
00:14:14,420 --> 00:14:16,290
Because I tore them up.

176
00:14:21,470 --> 00:14:28,190
[Blood Testing Room]

177
00:14:26,960 --> 00:14:28,250
I know I'm a jerk.

178
00:14:30,150 --> 00:14:31,480
But I was just thinking,

179
00:14:33,750 --> 00:14:35,670
if losing one kidney is fine,

180
00:14:37,190 --> 00:14:38,990
why do we have two?

181
00:14:41,520 --> 00:14:43,300
If I only have one...

182
00:14:45,510 --> 00:14:46,370
and it failed,

183
00:14:48,320 --> 00:14:49,770
wouldn't I be done for?

184
00:14:51,240 --> 00:14:52,440
I'm afraid of dying.

185
00:14:55,650 --> 00:14:56,790
I'm a coward.

186
00:14:57,980 --> 00:15:00,040
They all laugh at me for being stingy.

187
00:15:02,120 --> 00:15:03,980
But I just want to make some money.

188
00:15:07,130 --> 00:15:08,700
And get my sister treated.

189
00:15:18,170 --> 00:15:19,550
I'm a good person.

190
00:15:20,210 --> 00:15:22,010
I think you're already amazing.

191
00:16:05,770 --> 00:16:07,700
A hair wash doesn't cost that much.

192
00:16:08,720 --> 00:16:10,180
Consider it a membership.

193
00:16:10,750 --> 00:16:12,080
Your hair isn't dry yet.

194
00:16:12,550 --> 00:16:13,410
I'll dry it outside.
